WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
Why does far less of the energy captured by Bay plankton reach the osprey level?

2
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.240
Watch a gold band of energy cross the Chesapeake Bay.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.940
It enters green phytoplankton from sunlight.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.220
Then teal zooplankton, menhaden, and an osprey take turns feeding.

5
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.260
The band will change at every step.

6
00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:29.757
Phytoplankton are producers because they capture light energy and store it in food.

7
00:00:31.157 --> 00:00:34.417
Animals are consumers because they get energy by eating.

8
00:00:35.857 --> 00:00:39.057
Blue decomposers get energy from dead matter and wastes.

9
00:00:40.537 --> 00:00:42.317
Gold arrows point from food to eater.

10
00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:46.997
Those arrows follow energy, not the animal doing the hunting.

11
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:51.570
When zooplankton feed, the incoming gold band splits.

12
00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:56.370
Cellular respiration releases part as spreading red heat.

13
00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:01.950
Uneaten pieces and undigested waste move toward blue decomposers.

14
00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.210
Only the tissue branch becomes new zooplankton tissue.

15
00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:10.610
That branch is available to a menhaden that feeds next.

16
00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.550
Zooplankton feed is available to a menhaden that feeds next.

17
00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:14.590
Now follow the same split inside a menhaden.

18
00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:18.110
Which outgoing branch can become osprey tissue?

19
00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.730
Watch all branches form.

20
00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.550
Choose before the labels appear.

21
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:33.407
The branch stored as new menhaden tissue can feed the osprey.

22
00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.767
Heat has dispersed into water and air.

23
00:01:38.087 --> 00:01:41.847
Uneaten or undigested material can still feed decomposers.

24
00:01:43.127 --> 00:01:45.667
It does not become osprey tissue through this link.

25
00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:49.087
The gold band reaching the osprey is narrower.

26
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.910
Ecologists compare levels with energy transfer efficiency.

27
00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:58.690
It is the percentage measured at a level that appears at the next.

28
00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:02.910
The measurements must match in kind, area, and time.

29
00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:07.650
A familiar percentage appears on screen as a rough model.

30
00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:11.130
Real feeding steps can be higher or lower.

31
00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:15.773
Stack those matching measurements, with producers at the bottom.

32
00:02:17.013 --> 00:02:18.933
The result is an energy pyramid.

33
00:02:20.293 --> 00:02:23.893
Each bar is narrower because only part became new tissue above.

34
00:02:25.213 --> 00:02:29.093
The shape tracks energy flow, not the body size of any organism.

35
00:02:30.513 --> 00:02:33.633
Many small producers can support fewer large predators.

36
00:02:34.783 --> 00:02:36.903
A real food web adds branches.

37
00:02:38.443 --> 00:02:40.803
Menhaden eat phytoplankton and zooplankton.

38
00:02:42.263 --> 00:02:43.963
Striped bass also eat menhaden.

39
00:02:45.123 --> 00:02:48.403
An osprey's trophic level can change with the path you follow.

40
00:02:49.683 --> 00:02:51.983
The same accounting still works at every link.

41
00:02:53.343 --> 00:02:55.283
Follow arrows from each food to its eater.

42
00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:57.927
Return to the osprey.

43
00:02:59.187 --> 00:03:02.407
Its food energy began with producers capturing sunlight.

44
00:03:03.747 --> 00:03:07.807
Along the path, heat spread and other material moved toward decomposers.

45
00:03:09.087 --> 00:03:11.547
The energy was transformed, not destroyed.

46
00:03:12.787 --> 00:03:17.267
But at each feeding step, only the tissue branch became available to the next

47
00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:18.267
consumer.

48
00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:23.690
That is why energy pyramids narrow even when the exact percentage changes.

49
00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:27.550
Use the rule before any shortcut percentage.

50
00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:32.370
At each step, only part becomes tissue the next level can eat.
